{"paragraphs":[{"sentences":[{"id":1,"text":"How to Set Up a Home Backup That Actually Works"}]},{"sentences":[{"id":2,"text":"Most people think about backups only after something breaks. "},{"id":3,"text":"A laptop falls off a table, a drive stops spinning, and years of photos disappear. "},{"id":4,"text":"The good news is that a reliable backup takes about an hour to build, and it needs very little care afterward."}]},{"sentences":[{"id":5,"text":"There are three parts to a backup that works. "},{"id":6,"text":"First, you need a copy of your files on a second device in the same room. "},{"id":7,"text":"This protects you from a dead disk, which is the most common failure. "},{"id":8,"text":"Buy an external drive with at least twice the space of your main disk. "},{"id":9,"text":"Plug it in, and let your computer's built-in backup tool format it."}]},{"sentences":[{"id":10,"text":"Before you go further, check one thing. "},{"id":11,"text":"Open the drive and look at the first folder it created. "},{"id":12,"text":"If you see your documents there, the copy works. "},{"id":13,"text":"If the folder is empty, stop and repeat the setup, because everything after this point depends on it."}]},{"sentences":[{"id":14,"text":"Many guides tell you to buy the biggest drive on the market. "},{"id":15,"text":"That advice is unnecessary. "},{"id":16,"text":"A drive twice the size of your data gives you months of history, and a bigger one only gives you a higher bill."}]},{"sentences":[{"id":17,"text":"Second, you need a copy in another place. "},{"id":18,"text":"Fire, theft, and floods take the drive and the laptop together, so a second copy in the same room does not help with them. "},{"id":19,"text":"An online backup service solves this. "},{"id":20,"text":"Pick one that encrypts your files before they leave your machine, and write down the recovery key on paper. "},{"id":21,"text":"A service with a lost key is the same as no service at all."}]},{"sentences":[{"id":22,"text":"I made this mistake myself with my first drive. "},{"id":23,"text":"A friend gave me a second-hand disk for free, and I trusted it for two years. "},{"id":24,"text":"Then one morning it would not mount. "},{"id":25,"text":"That was the first time I learned that a used drive can fail without warning. "},{"id":26,"text":"After that, I bought a new one every four years."}]},{"sentences":[{"id":27,"text":"Third, you must test the restore. "},{"id":28,"text":"Many people skip this step, and it is the only step that proves the backup works. "},{"id":29,"text":"Pick one file, delete it, and bring it back from each copy. "},{"id":30,"text":"Then do the same with a whole folder. "},{"id":31,"text":"If either test fails, fix the problem now, while nothing is at stake."}]},{"sentences":[{"id":32,"text":"Once the three parts are in place, set a schedule. "},{"id":33,"text":"Next, tell the tool to run every night, and set the online service to upload only when the laptop is plugged in. "},{"id":34,"text":"Then leave the system alone for a week. "},{"id":35,"text":"Do not change the settings while you wait, because you want to see how it behaves on ordinary days."}]},{"sentences":[{"id":36,"text":"After a week, open the log. "},{"id":37,"text":"You should see seven nightly runs. "},{"id":38,"text":"If one is missing, the laptop was probably asleep, so move the schedule to a time when you are at your desk. "},{"id":39,"text":"Either the run happens at a time the machine is awake, or it does not happen at all."}]},{"sentences":[{"id":40,"text":"Some people keep the first backup forever and never look at it again. "},{"id":41,"text":"That is a trap. "},{"id":42,"text":"Put a reminder in your calendar for the first Monday of every quarter. "},{"id":43,"text":"On that day, restore one random file and confirm that it opens. "},{"id":44,"text":"The check takes two minutes, and it catches problems before they matter."}]},{"sentences":[{"id":45,"text":"Finally, label the drive with the date you bought it. "},{"id":46,"text":"Drives do not announce their age, so the label is your only warning. "},{"id":47,"text":"Replace it after four years, even if it looks healthy."}]},{"sentences":[{"id":48,"text":"Not only does this routine protect your photos, but it also protects your work files, your tax records, and your email. "},{"id":49,"text":"If you follow the steps, you will lose nothing the next time a laptop falls off a table."}]}],"annotations":[{"id":"a1","candidate":"c7","sentence":6,"pos":0,"end":5,"kind":"sequence","type":"sequence","layout":"sequence","before_start":6,"after_end":9,"importance":3,"source":"lexicon","rule":"first-list","link":null,"role":null,"visible":true,"number":1,"list":"list1","list_size":5},{"id":"a2","candidate":"c15","sentence":12,"pos":0,"end":2,"kind":"condition","type":"reasoning","layout":"mark","before_start":12,"after_end":12,"importance":3,"source":"lexicon","rule":"if","link":null,"role":null,"visible":true},{"id":"a3","candidate":"c16","sentence":13,"pos":0,"end":2,"kind":"condition","type":"reasoning","layout":"mark","before_start":13,"after_end":13,"importance":3,"source":"lexicon","rule":"if","link":null,"role":null,"visible":true},{"id":"a4","candidate":"c18","sentence":13,"pos":51,"end":58,"kind":"cause","type":"reasoning","layout":"mark","before_start":13,"after_end":13,"importance":3,"source":"lexicon","rule":"lexicon-auto","link":null,"role":null,"visible":true},{"id":"a5","candidate":"c21","sentence":17,"pos":0,"end":6,"kind":"sequence","type":"sequence","layout":"sequence","before_start":17,"after_end":21,"importance":3,"source":"lexicon","rule":"lexicon-auto","link":null,"role":null,"visible":true,"number":2,"list":"list1","list_size":5},{"id":"a6","candidate":"c26","sentence":18,"pos":64,"end":66,"kind":"result","type":"reasoning","layout":"mark","before_start":18,"after_end":18,"importance":3,"source":"lexicon","rule":"so-result","link":null,"role":null,"visible":true},{"id":"a7","candidate":"c35","se